What does this code print?
```java
int a = 7;
int b = 2;
System.out.print(a / b + " " + a % b);
```

What does this code print?
```java
int total = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
    total += i;
}
System.out.print(total);
```

What does this code print?
```java
int code = 2;
switch (code) {
    case 1: System.out.print("A"); break;
    case 2: System.out.print("B"); break;
    default: System.out.print("C");
}
```

How many times does this loop print `*`?
```java
int n = 3;
while (n > 0) {
    System.out.print("*");
    n--;
}
```

What value is assigned to `label`?
```java
int marks = 65;
String label = marks >= 50 ? "Pass" : "Retry";
```

What does this code print?
```java
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
    if (i == 3) continue;
    if (i == 5) break;
    System.out.print(i);
}
```

What does this code print?
```java
int first = 4;
int second = first;
second = 9;
System.out.print(first);
```

What does this code print?
```java
int[] values = {4, 7, 2};
System.out.print(values[0] + values[2]);
```

What does this code print?
```java
int count = 0;
do {
    count++;
} while (count < 1);
System.out.print(count);
```

What does this code print?
```java
class Item {
    Item() { System.out.print("Created"); }
}
Item item = new Item();
```

What does this code print?
```java
class Box { int value; }
Box a = new Box();
Box b = a;
b.value = 8;
System.out.print(a.value);
```

What does this code print?
```java
class Animal { void sound() { System.out.print("A"); } }
class Dog extends Animal { @Override void sound() { System.out.print("D"); } }
Animal pet = new Dog();
pet.sound();
```

Given the code below, which statement is true?
```java
class Employee { void work() { } }
class Manager extends Employee { }
Manager m = new Manager();
```

Which statement about this declaration is correct?
```java
abstract class Shape {
    abstract double area();
}
```

What is true about this non-static inner class?
```java
class Outer {
    private int value = 5;
    class Inner {
        int getValue() { return value; }
    }
}
```

What does this code demonstrate?
```java
Runnable task = new Runnable() {
    public void run() { System.out.print("Done"); }
};
```

Which constructor call matches this class?
```java
class Product {
    Product(String name, double price) { }
}
```

What does this code print?
```java
try {
    System.out.print("T");
} catch (RuntimeException e) {
    System.out.print("C");
} finally {
    System.out.print("F");
}
```

What happens if this condition is true?
```java
if (age < 0) {
    throw new IllegalArgumentException("age must not be negative");
}
```

In this structure, where can an exception thrown in the inner `try` be handled?
```java
try {
    try {
        riskyOperation();
    } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
        handleInputError();
    }
} catch (Exception e) {
    handleOtherError();
}
```

What does this code print?
```java
String word = "data";
word.concat("base");
System.out.print(word);
```

What does this code print?
```java
String a = new String("Java");
String b = new String("Java");
System.out.print(a.equals(b) + " " + (a == b));
```

What does this code print?
```java
StringBuilder text = new StringBuilder("B");
text.append("DA");
text.insert(1, "I");
System.out.print(text);
```

